---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Solutions | Nodix Solar PV Tools" description="Solar PV installation tools, OEM programs and factory-backed sourcing solutions for distributors and professional buyers.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="kicker">NODIX / SOLUTIONS</div><h1>Tools around<br/><em>the real workflow.</em></h1><p>We keep the range focused on the tasks that happen around PV cable preparation, connector assembly, installation and field service.</p></section>
  <section class="section solution-flow" id="installers"><div class="section-head"><h2>CUT → STRIP →<br/>CRIMP → CONNECT</h2><p>Instead of selling an unrelated catalogue, we build product combinations around the actual installation workflow. That makes product selection, training and procurement easier for professional buyers.</p></div><div class="workflow-grid"><div class="step"><b>01</b><h3>CUT</h3><p>Clean cable preparation for installation and service work.</p></div><div class="step"><b>02</b><h3>STRIP</h3><p>Controlled insulation removal for connector preparation.</p></div><div class="step"><b>03</b><h3>CRIMP</h3><p>Repeatable terminal crimping with the correct tool profile.</p></div><div class="step"><b>04</b><h3>CONNECT</h3><p>Practical assembly and disconnect tools for field work.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="section" id="distributors"><div class="split"><div class="dark-panel"><div class="kicker">01 / DISTRIBUTORS</div><h3>Focused product ranges.</h3><p>Select a small group of complementary PV tools for your existing solar, electrical or hardware channel. We can discuss packaging and quantity around the program.</p></div><div class="dark-panel"><div class="kicker">02 / INSTALLERS</div><h3>Tools for field work.</h3><p>Source the core hand tools used by installation and service teams without building a catalogue around unrelated products.</p></div><div class="dark-panel" id="oem"><div class="kicker">03 / OEM</div><h3>Private-label supply.</h3><p>Discuss logo application, packaging, tool combinations and product documentation for your own brand or distributor program.</p></div><div class="dark-panel"><div class="kicker">04 / CUSTOM</div><h3>Build a practical kit.</h3><p>Start with the installation tasks, then define the tool combination and packaging. Customization can follow the product requirement rather than the other way around.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="section-head"><h2>What we can<br/>work on together.</h2><p>Bring us a reference product, target quantity, cable size, connector system or packaging idea. We can start from the information you already have.</p></div><div class="capability-list"><div><strong>PRODUCT SOURCING</strong><span>PV cable cutters, strippers, crimpers and connector tools.</span></div><div><strong>TOOL COMBINATIONS</strong><span>Installer-focused kits built around defined tasks.</span></div><div><strong>OEM / PRIVATE LABEL</strong><span>Logo, packaging and distributor-oriented product programs.</span></div><div><strong>DOCUMENTATION</strong><span>Product specifications and applicable factory documentation as confirmed.</span></div></div></section>
  <section class="cta-band"><div class="cta-inner"><h2>Have a specific requirement?</h2><a class="btn" href="/contact">Start a Conversation ↗</a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
